  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DEC Middle East Humanitarian Appeal - Phase 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GAZA: ACF is implementing a comprehensive nutrition program to reduce malnutrition-related morbidity and mortality among children and women. Services include mobile and fixed nutrition points, Mother and Baby Friendly Spaces, malnutrition screening and treatment, and support for infant and young child feeding. DEC funding is being used to maintain staffing, expand IYCF services, distribute essential non-food items, and improve access to treatment through transportation support.LEBANON: ACF is providing multipurpose cash assistance for three months to vulnerable households&#xe2;&#x20ac;&#x201d;particularly in the heavily impacted South and Nabatieh governorates&#xe2;&#x20ac;&#x201d;to support food, shelter, and WASH needs. The intervention prioritizes gender and disability inclusion, offering tailored support to households led by women or caring for dependents. ACF also applies protection-sensitive approaches and tools to enhance accessibility and ensure dignified aid delivery.</narrative>
  </description>
